===Gabby and Ty===
[[Gabby and Ty]], the reporter-cameraman team you met back in {{ci|Slateport}}, can be found standing along the road. Accept their challenge to demonstrate your battle prowess, and they will beg for an interview afterwards. Find a [[Television|TV]] afterwards for a chance to hear about yourself on the news!

==Route 112 (south)==
[[File:Hoenn Route 112 E.png|thumb|Route 112]]
[[File:Fiery Path RSE.png|thumb|Fiery Path]]

