==Fallarbor Town==
[[File:Fallarbor Town E.png|thumb|Fallarbor Town]]

The small town of {{to|Fallarbor}} is located between Routes {{rtn|113|Hoenn}} and {{rtn|114|Hoenn}}, and features rich soil perfect for gardening. A third [[Battle Tent]] is located here. The town is also home to a [[Move Reminder|Move Maniac]] and [[Professor Cozmo]].

